WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.110
Good morning John.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:05.150
You and I have been making videos for over
8 years now, over 1200 videos on this channel

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.150
alone.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.820
Enough 4 minute videos to keep a person busy
for days without sleeping.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:15.690
In that time, I've told the whole world, everyone
who will listen, some of my deepest fears

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.700
and most embarrassing moments.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:20.270
I mean I've experienced some of my most embarrassing
moments on this YouTube channel.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.790
There's not a lot about me left that isn't
public.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.560
It's to the point that I would have a really
hard time coming up with a 2 Truths and a

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:31.610
Lie that I could catch anybody on, because
all of the interesting things about me you

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:32.610
know.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:33.610
I've got very little left.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:35.500
This is not a complaint; I like it this way.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.690
But being this open with the world also makes
you think about the secrets you do keep.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:40.690
Those things do exist.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.620
And I don't think there's anything weird about
that; I don't think anyone on either side

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:47.710
of this situation thinks that I should share
everything about everything about myself.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:52.330
But what is weird, is when I'm feeling something,
when I'm excited or frustrated or angry, and

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:56.390
I can't talk about that, because I can't tell
you why.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:59.550
Either because of contracts or responsibilities
or strategies even.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:03.550
I don't know if you know this, John I'm not
talking to you now, I'm talking to Nerdfighteria,

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.260
you're really important in my life.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:10.580
It feels really weird; it feels wrong for
important things to happen in my life and

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.111
to not talk about it.

00:01:12.111 --> 00:01:14.580
Whether it's on a video or on Twitter or Tumblr
or Facebook.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.640
I'm not good at faking stuff.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:20.960
I can't suddenly get excited about something
that I've been doing for 6 months, just because

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.210
now it's public.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:27.229
I've been excited that whole time; I can't
pack that all in into one announcement video.

00:01:27.229 --> 00:01:30.820
So when I'm super excited or frustrated or
angry about something and I can't talk about

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:32.640
it, that makes me feel weird.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:34.420
It makes me feel like a liar.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:35.770
Being honest here.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:36.780
Honest about my lying.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.640
Things like SciShow Kids and CrashCourse Kids,
which we've been working on for months, getting

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:45.170
funding together and defining them and doing
character development and hiring people who

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:49.400
are amazing to do all this great animation
and work, and we weren't allowed to talk about

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.400
any of it.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.130
All that enthusiasm was so annoyingly private.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:56.670
But those things are real now, and I am still
excited about them and have been excited about

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:00.350
them for so long, so if there are kids in
your life or there are parents who have kids

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:01.680
in your life, please tell them.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.700
Cause if people don't watch it, we can't keep
making it.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:07.549
Right now we've got 2 things that I'm very
excited about that I cannot tell you about,

00:02:07.549 --> 00:02:09.479
and I am just so frus-.

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:14.340
It's not like new hoodie designs or video
ideas or something like that, it's big stuff,

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.433
you're not gonna guess, but I encourage you
to try.

00:02:16.433 --> 00:02:20.540
And I feel like a phony for being excited
and not being able to tell you why.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.310
One of those things will be announced early
next week; I'll be doing a Reddit AMA about

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.310
it on Monday.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:28.599
And the other will be announced a week after
that, if all goes according to plan.

00:02:28.599 --> 00:02:32.610
Vlogbrothers has always been about honesty
and authenticity and just being who you are

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.099
and feeling what you feel and talking about
the things that are happening, hopefully in

00:02:35.099 --> 00:02:38.450
interesting ways that are entertaining, or
thought provoking, or whatever.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:43.540
But as the scope with SciShow and CrashCourse
and VidCon and DFTBA, all these things, has

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:48.989
grown, I've had less freedom to talk about
them because there's just more complicated

00:02:48.989 --> 00:02:50.320
infrastructure on top of it.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.810
And I'm so happy to be working on big complicated
projects with talented people, but sometimes

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.000
I just wish I could take everyone along for
the ride, you know?

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.030
It's been a long time.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.160
I'm not used to living that kind of private
life anymore.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.569
Especially with my work stuff.

00:03:02.569 --> 00:03:04.599
I feel like that stuff should be public.

00:03:04.599 --> 00:03:08.069
It feels wrong, but I don't have any choice,
and I don't know if it's better for me to

00:03:08.069 --> 00:03:13.050
talk about this or not because now you know
that I'm keeping stuff from you, whereas before

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.660
you could just sort of infer it.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:18.110
And, you're gonna be like "What the-fr-what
are you work- what's the thing?

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:19.760
Are you making a new kind of ice cream?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:20.790
And you gonna be an astronaut?"

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:21.790
No.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.489
Neither of those things, but, uh, again I
encourage you to guess in the comments because

00:03:25.489 --> 00:03:27.510
maybe you'll give me good ideas of things
to do in the future.

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.830
Anyway, I'm very excited and I can't say why.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.849
You'll find out next week and then week after
that.

00:03:31.849 --> 00:03:32.849
I'll be cool.

00:03:32.849 --> 00:03:36.750
I'm excited to share them with you then and
I'm excited to sharing my whole freaking life

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:41.090
with you in the future for a very long, long
time.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.660
John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

